                        "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                        "entry_id": "a544d4c0-8a2b-3544-a749-541743beb0f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Like a thief; thievish."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09060c98-7c23-49b1-8f7c-521680c961d9",
                                "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                                "text": "Most patiently, with noiseless tread, I then did Make thro' those sumptuous halls my thiefly way, Until at last I reached the chamber splendid Where Hobart Chatfield Chatfield slumb'ring lay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d327241d-a03b-498d-918c-d89b2f434ba0",
                                "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                                "text": "In bantering gusto he went right on with his thiefly enterprise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac7b6827-0e1b-4733-b8e5-33ca65d0d787",
                                "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                                "text": "Rogues are characters with some expertise in thiefly abilities and more specialized knowledge of arms than that possessed by Fighters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "222463ab-5b57-4bd7-b0fd-d012447aff77",
                                "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                                "text": "It would be a sad thing to enter this dark time and then to have an eternal reality stolen and lessened in a thiefly sort of way at the door of death through a life that was lived in a less than honorable fashion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b8a4902-6e26-4d74-9ede-de11bb5ce7d8",
                                "sense_id": "f7adb320-8815-331e-80b8-2b586bfac5ed",
                                "text": "...here he was, bent on one last thiefly act."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
