                                "sense_id": "44f56a0c-f6ad-334b-bd0e-a80421e64813",
                                "text": "What great is living so thiefly!!! (Like a thief)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d01d0eee-caf6-4a0d-a8d9-512d55ed383e",
                                "sense_id": "44f56a0c-f6ad-334b-bd0e-a80421e64813",
                                "text": "Downyng described Sybbesoun as \"a strong thief to Wood Mill, for truly he and his wife have procured my servant and my goods, that is to say wheat and rye by the bushel and the half, as thiefly and as un-truly as he might do.\""
                            }
                        ]
